<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96832" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίξ</span></b> , ἡ, gen. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιχός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.173
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				20.362
			</span></i>, acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχα</span> Epigr. ap.
				<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				11.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.56
			</span></i>; nom. and acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχες,
			στίχας</span> (v. infr.):—<i>row, line, rank</i> or
				<i>file</i>, esp. of soldiers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς μὲν ἰῆς στιχὸς ἦρχε Μενέσθιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.173
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιχὸς εἶμι διαμπερές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.362
				</span></i>
			, cf. Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
			</span></i> l.c.: elsewhere in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχες
				ἀνδρῶν, Τρώων, Κεφαλλήνων</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.231
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				221
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				330
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπιστάων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				90
			</span></i>; mostly of foot, but also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰς ς. ἡρώων πολλὰς δὲ καὶ ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.326
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ στίχας</span>
			<i>in ranks</i> or <i>lines</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵζοντο
				κατὰ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				3.326
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦλθε κατὰ ς</span>.
				<i>through the ranks</i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.820
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.590
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.91
			</span></i>; of dancers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρέξασκον ἐπὶ στίχας ἀλλήλοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.602
				</span></i>
			:—also in Trag. and Com., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξένων στίχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					924
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμίων,
			Καδμείων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				676
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				669
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν λαῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					163
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συῶν ἠδὲ λεόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					170
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεράνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					1031
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				11.114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέμων στίχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.210
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέων στίχες</span>
			<i>verses, lays</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i>; later, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχα νήσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					514
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίβλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.56
				</span></i>
			.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχος,
			στοῖχος</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
